{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：09:28 2026-10-12 HKT</p>\n\n<p>慈雲山慈正邨有人墮樓死亡。今日（12日）早上8時31分，警方接獲報案，指正旭樓一名男子墮樓，倒臥在平台上，不省人事。救援人員趕到，發現事主已經死亡，消防員協助將遺體抬回地面。</p>\n<p>現場消息稱，死者是一名13歲少年，警方正調查其墮樓原因。</p>\n<img alt=\"少年墮樓死亡，警方在場調查。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/85b3db9f90c8a5a0bcf78464ff284bbb/2026-10/1_1_14.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a96bff30b0e329de0663a3c6feba0b42/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_10_29_50_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場是正旭樓。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/04e09298b635acd41c5e25a23608d882/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_10_29_50.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/70011e7c7e6291f7b0092e5173b799f4/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_10_29_49.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/6c2754b3ed7e0f2fe87d97f8f9000660/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_10_29_48_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/eb61fc3d50a967a96c94b772049fa3e6/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-12_at_10_29_48.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T02:38:11.682897+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}